From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 18:35:59 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mt76: mt7925: keep the RX PN state of a station across a rekey

Upstream: https://github.com/openwrt/mt76/commit/10983a4bdd412b8b047f8b6bb5160598627be2b7
Fixes: c948b5da6bbe ("wifi: mt76: mt7925: add Mediatek Wi-Fi7 driver for mt7925 chips")
Link: https://patch.msgid.link/20261125173616.3776951-1-nbd@nbd.name
Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>

diff --git a/mt7925/main.c b/mt7925/main.c
index cc407a0..b64fc7d 100644
--- a/mt7925/main.c
+++ b/mt7925/main.c
@@ -707,11 +707,11 @@ static int mt7925_set_link_key(struct ieee80211_hw *hw, enum set_key_cmd cmd,
 	else
 		goto out;
 
-	if (sta)
-		mt76_wcid_key_link_setup(wcid, cmd == SET_KEY ? key : NULL);
-	else
+	if (!sta)
 		mt76_wcid_key_setup(&dev->mt76, wcid,
 				    cmd == SET_KEY ? key : NULL);
+	else if (cmd == SET_KEY)
+		mt76_wcid_key_link_setup(wcid, key);
 
 	err = mt7925_mcu_add_key(&dev->mt76, vif, &mlink->bip,
 				 key, MCU_UNI_CMD(STA_REC_UPDATE),
